                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.113/399a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Schurman</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-11-22T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 22,
                                1922—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>270. Department’s 262, November 11th, 7 P.M. You may present formula to
                    Diplomatic Body for consideration.</p>
                <p>Repeat to Tokyo for its information as Department’s 144.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
